# ML and prediction validation

Require provenance, point-in-time availability, versioned features/labels/models, chronological OOS or walk-forward, a simple baseline, and prediction-to-outcome lineage. A pickle is not a valid model. A single accuracy or PnL number cannot promote.

Do not pad, truncate, or reorder features silently. Schema mismatch is CANNOT_SCORE / FAIL closed. No automatic LIVE, capital, or production-code self-mutation.

Multibagger output is equity RESEARCH_CANDIDATE, HIGH_RISK, NOT_INVESTMENT_ADVICE, NOT_PROVEN when unproven. Never display option contracts as equity multibaggers. Never guarantee returns.
